| disk, best-eta mode | 0.9418 | 0.0157 | 0.02 | 1.097e-02 | 116.22 | 64.77 | 0.086 | 2.532e-05 |
| disk, best-energy mode | 0.5189 | 0.0519 | 0.10 | 1.097e-02 | 112.40 | 64.53 | 0.656 | 5.853e-05 |
