| optimized (binary, connected) | 0.6737 | 0.1102 | 0.16 | 1.097e-02 | 306.12 | 16.74 | 0.033 | 4.039e-06 |

- **eta ratio, optimized (binary, connected) vs disk's best-eta mode: 2.634, so SUPPORTED**
